# Shelly Script Deployment Configuration
# Format: DEVICE_IP:SCRIPT_ID:SCRIPT_FILE:SCRIPT_NAME
#
# DEVICE_IP    - IP address of Shelly device
# SCRIPT_ID    - Script slot number (1-10, recommend using 1)
# SCRIPT_FILE  - Path to JavaScript file
# SCRIPT_NAME  - Display name for the script

# Dump Load Controllers (4x immersion heaters; one is the lead relay)
192.168.1.100:1:soc-relay-controller.js:Dump Load
192.168.1.101:1:soc-relay-controller.js:Dump Load
192.168.1.102:1:soc-relay-controller.js:Dump Load
192.168.1.103:1:soc-relay-controller.js:Dump Load

# Heat Pump Enable: same script, role resolved from the device ID
192.168.1.109:1:soc-relay-controller.js:Heat Pump Enable

# Boiler Release: follows the heat pump lock and the DHW time clock
192.168.1.110:1:heating-relay-controller.js:Boiler Release

# Thermal Dump Controller (1x device)
192.168.1.104:1:thermal-dump-controller.js:Thermal Dump

# Surplus Dump Controller (1x device)
192.168.1.105:1:surplus-dump-controller.js:Surplus Dump
